[03:01 - 03:02] SPEAKER_00: "Will we even be writing books?"
[03:04 - 03:17] SPEAKER_00: "And I think one reason why it feels different this time is because AI, unlike the iPhone, is the first tool that we've built that's capable of leaving the toolbox, and we don't yet know its limits."
